62	     * in {@link #getPreloadRequestBuilder(Object)}. If that's not possible for any set of models,
63	     * avoid including them in the {@link List} returned by this method.
64	     *
65	     * <p>Although it's acceptable for the returned {@link List} to contain {@code null} models,
66	     * it's best to filter them from the list instead of adding {@code null} to avoid unnecessary
