16	/**
17	 * Loads a few resources ahead in the direction of scrolling in any {@link AbsListView} so that
18	 * images are in the memory cache just before the corresponding view in created in the list. Gives
19	 * the appearance of an infinitely large image cache, depending on scrolling speed, cpu speed, and
