235	   * we appear to be passing {@link RequestListener}s added to the parent request to the generated
236	   * thumbnail requests. To try to reduce confusion, the {@link #thumbnail(float)} method has been
237	   * deprecated. It can be easily replicated using {@link #thumbnail(RequestBuilder)} and {@link
238	   * BaseRequestOptions#sizeMultiplier(float)}.
