418	   * RequestBuilder} at position 0 has the {@link RequestBuilder} at position 1 applied as using its
419	   * thumbnail method, the {@link RequestBuilder} at position 1 has the {@link RequestBuilder} at
420	   * position 2 applied using its thumbnail method and so on.
421	   *
