9	 * disk cache directory, which falls back to the internal disk cache if no external storage is
10	 * available. If ever fell back to the internal disk cache, will use that one from that moment on.
11	 *
12	 * <p><b>Images can be read by everyone when using external disk cache.</b>
13	 */
