12	/**
13	 * For a given {@link com.bumptech.glide.load.data.DataFetcher} for a given data class, attempts to
14	 * fetch the data and then run it through one or more {@link
15	 * com.bumptech.glide.load.engine.DecodePath}s.
16	 *
17	 * @param <Data> The type of data that will be fetched.
