178	  /**
179	   * Sets a mark position in this stream. The parameter {@code readlimit} indicates how many bytes
180	   * can be read before a mark is invalidated. Calling {@link #reset()} will reposition the stream
181	   * back to the marked position if {@code readlimit} has not been surpassed. The underlying buffer
